    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "College students are always tired."
      },
      {
        "text": "Most don't get enough sleep."
      },
      {
        "text": "That can hurt their grades and mental health."
      },
      {
        "text": "But a new study found a simple fix."
      },
      {
        "text": "Small cash rewards and bedtime reminders helped students sleep more."
      },
      {
        "text": "They got 19 more minutes a night."
      },
      {
        "text": "And their grades improved."
      },
      {
        "text": "The boost stuck even after the rewards stopped."
      },
      {
        "text": "This shows better sleep can help students do better."
      },
      {
        "text": "Especially freshmen and STEM students."
      },
      {
        "text": "So how much do you think sleep affects your day?"
      }
